    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/a64922dfd536bbfc44fa8607c5ab8bc6.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Dora\u2019s good amigo, Ale, was telling her and Boots about the vibrant Alebrije Tree. Tico came by to show them his Super-Duper Duplicator, when ...SWIPE! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/d56ad02eb03e3ac78183ea9c01d1c32d.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/d56ad02eb03e3ac78183ea9c01d1c32d.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/d56ad02eb03e3ac78183ea9c01d1c32d.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It could only be one sneaky fox, Swiper. He got his pesky paws on the Duplicator, and now it has overloaded, spreading the magical leaves and pods of the tree. But that\u2019s not their only problem. Now clones of Swiper are causing chaos in the Rainforest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/00acae541b188aa16ad7e71b49d5d51e.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Join Dora and Boots on an interactive adventure to stop Swiper\u2019s clones, fix the Duplicator, and save the vibrant Alebrije Tree where the Baby Alejibres live.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/bb982f3d44fdd5d892a50c824ac71903.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/bb982f3d44fdd5d892a50c824ac71903.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/bb982f3d44fdd5d892a50c824ac71903.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Along the way, you\u2019ll meet your amigos, working with them to sort out the mess Swiper has left behind. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/3862541bb9560ee19ec75327ba2a4e6b.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Go to the Nutty Forest and find Tico in his Workshop, building parts for the Race Challenge. Chase Clouds with Isa and watch the plants grow in the Flowery Garden. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/f8aecd279db4c236ce963d6580973b3e.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/f8aecd279db4c236ce963d6580973b3e.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/f8aecd279db4c236ce963d6580973b3e.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fly through the Green Hills with Benny\u2019s Balloons. Move with Big Red Chicken in the Musical Forest. Ride through the Land of the Alebrijes with Ale. \u00a1Qu\u00e9 Aventura!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/511c461dd3dc90f4636f97ba564a81a9.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Run, jump, and swing through the Rainforest, collecting Magic Leaves and pods. Follow secret paths to unlock new places and objects. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/4123344110aebae82145be4cd1fd41c2.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/4123344110aebae82145be4cd1fd41c2.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/4123344110aebae82145be4cd1fd41c2.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Solve Grumpy Old Troll\u2019s riddles, use clues from friends, and call on Map to guide you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/6d289ad85f382a4837a55c793c663ac0.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Stop Swiper from swiping while playing solo or team up with grown-ups or fellow explorers in local co-op mode.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/56744a04f26d49eec56f0ef950ca3bdf.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/56744a04f26d49eec56f0ef950ca3bdf.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/56744a04f26d49eec56f0ef950ca3bdf.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Do you want to join Dora and her friends on this fun quest? <br>\u00a1V\u00e1monos! Let\u2019s go!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>JOIN YOUR AMIGOS: Play as Dora and Boots in solo or local co-op mode in an interactive adventure.<br></li><li>SAVE THE ALEBRIJE TREE: Search for the lost leaves and pods and return the magic.<br></li><li>EXPLORE THE RAINFOREST: Jump, run, bounce, and swing through five locations.<br></li><li>WORK, LAUGH &amp; DANCE: Complete challenges with Ale, Tico, Isa, Benny, and Big Red Chicken.<br></li><li>DISCOVER, COLLECT &amp; EARN: Follow secret paths to unlock new areas and skills, collect items and earn crystals.<br></li><li>STOP SWIPER FROM SWIPING: Find Swiper\u2019s pesky clones and stop them from causing chaos all over the Rainforest.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/a64922dfd536bbfc44fa8607c5ab8bc6.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Dora\u2019s good amigo, Ale, was telling her and Boots about the vibrant Alebrije Tree. Tico came by to show them his Super-Duper Duplicator, when ...SWIPE! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/d56ad02eb03e3ac78183ea9c01d1c32d.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/d56ad02eb03e3ac78183ea9c01d1c32d.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/d56ad02eb03e3ac78183ea9c01d1c32d.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It could only be one sneaky fox, Swiper. He got his pesky paws on the Duplicator, and now it has overloaded, spreading the magical leaves and pods of the tree. But that\u2019s not their only problem. Now clones of Swiper are causing chaos in the Rainforest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/00acae541b188aa16ad7e71b49d5d51e.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Join Dora and Boots on an interactive adventure to stop Swiper\u2019s clones, fix the Duplicator, and save the vibrant Alebrije Tree where the Baby Alejibres live.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/bb982f3d44fdd5d892a50c824ac71903.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c