<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/4123344110aebae82145be4cd1fd41c2.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/4123344110aebae82145be4cd1fd41c2.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/4123344110aebae82145be4cd1fd41c2.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Solve Grumpy Old Troll\u2019s riddles, use clues from friends, and call on Map to guide you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/6d289ad85f382a4837a55c793c663ac0.avif?t=1752068829\" width=615 height=132 /></span><br>Stop Swiper from swiping while playing solo or team up with grown-ups or fellow explorers in local co-op mode.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/56744a04f26d49eec56f0ef950ca3bdf.poster.avif?t=1752068829\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/56744a04f26d49eec56f0ef950ca3bdf.webm?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273550/extras/56744a04f26d49eec56f0ef950ca3bdf.mp4?t=1752068829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Do you want to join Dora and her friends on this fun quest? <br>\u00a1V\u00e1monos! Let\u2019s go!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>JOIN YOUR AMIGOS: Play as Dora and Boots in solo or local co-op mode in an interactive adventure.<br></li><li>SAVE THE ALEBRIJE TREE: Search for the lost leaves and pods and return the magic.<br></li><li>EXPLORE THE RAINFOREST: Jump, run, bounce, and swing through five locations.<br></li><li>WORK, LAUGH &amp; DANCE: Complete challenges with Ale, Tico, Isa, Benny, and Big Red Chicken.<br></li><li>DISCOVER, COLLECT &amp; EARN: Follow secret paths to unlock new areas and skills, collect items and earn crystals.<br></li><li>STOP SWIPER FROM SWIPING: Find Swiper\u2019s pesky clones and stop them from causing chaos all over the Rainforest.</li></ul>",
